se and composition to you. It does not matter if she is not facing the front as long as her gaze is in front of you.\n　The facial expression should be a little smile.\n　For the design, please refer to the image at the URL of the document.\n\nUsage\n　 We would like to use the image as a thumbnail on YouTube and on social networking sites.\n　Therefore, we would appreciate it if the head and left and right sides of the image are not obscured.\n　If possible, we would appreciate it if you could make the background transparent.\n\n　Thank you in advance.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/g55vb2tz45n2y0fqviiw1/h?rlkey=3dv2haz46pluufzzpe34znyit&dl=0", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yonph2/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1154032, "client_id": 1363888, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff45691d1542872aeda8371a362dbf66", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff45691d1542872aeda8371a362dbf66, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=457cadeea1359ebe0c7480d06c383f6f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb94da278eb30236f1cedfa2386d693c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc4127f536aa7437c27bb0b4b485113e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc4127f536aa7437c27bb0b4b485113e, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=96fb2adadfe3c80019bf9c188a8688cd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=34968dd9d6dc656858b78ce9a0cfca21 3x"}, "body": "Hi Yonha! I'm glad to hear that skeb is now open! Please excuse my request...!\n\nIf you don't mind, I'd like to have Koji-kun and Yamato...! I would like to leave everything to you, including the composition of the illustration! I would be most happy if you could draw them as you like...!\nLastly, I wish you a long and healthy life...! I hope you have a long and healthy life!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yonph2/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1154032, "client_id": 953483, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a409571db314bab112f8e3dc8f0d76ba", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a409571db314bab112f8e3dc8f0d76ba, https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95e76b10569d299cca7155db45e6fc9e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e